OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opened into Taylor
OL,4,ACharlton's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has been opened into the
OL,7,Fdeath of a 15-year-old boy whose body
OL,8,Fwas found in a river six weeks after he
OL,9,Fhad been reported missing.
OL,11,FTaylor Charlton's body was found
OL,12,Ffloating near a bridge on the River Taw
OL,13,Fnear Sticklepath, Devon, on 24 June.
OL,15,FA large police search had been
OL,16,Fconducted in the weeks before his body
OL,17,Fwas found following his last confirmed
OL,18,Fsighting on a footpath near the Tarka
OL,19,FLeisure Centre in Barnstaple at about
OL,20,F22:40 BST on 8 May.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
