OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opened into Taylor
OL,4,ACharlton's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior Devon coroner Philip Spinney,
OL,7,Fwho said DNA tests on the body
OL,8,Fconfirmed it was Taylor, said the cause
OL,9,Fof death was unascertained and the
OL,10,Finquest in Exeter has been adjourned.
